<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Tasa Nafin August rate set at 23.83 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Tasa Nafin August rate set at 23.83 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican state development bank Nacional Financiera (Nafin) said on Monday its so-called Tasa Nafin interest rate for August was set at 23.83 percent.</p>
<p>The rate, used by the development bank on loans to small and medium-sized businesses and set once a month, rose 83 basis points from July's 23 percent.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7902))</p>
